fonts-ubuntu
fonts-noto
dbus-x11
nano
less
htop
e2fsprogs

# Terminal (OpenStore click: com.ubuntu.terminal — see clicks.core-apps.list)
# X11 apps (xgps, …) need Xwayland under Mir/qtmir; use hybris build on Halium.
xwayland-hybris



